下面的 Floyd 求任意两点最短路的代码在多数用例上能跑，但结果是错的。请指出问题并给出正确写法。

```c
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)
        for (int k = 0; k < n; k++)
            d[i][j] = min(d[i][j], d[i][k] + d[k][j]);
```

answer.reference_code:
for (int k = 0; k < n; k++)          /* k 必须在最外层 */
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
        for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)
            d[i][j] = min(d[i][j], d[i][k] + d[k][j]);

